            "displayName": "Angela Schreiber",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "looks good to me.\n\none thing:\nif we have a ValueConstraint in the spi-commons, i would like to use this one in jcr2spi and get rid\nof the constraint in jcr2spi (remove). if nobody objects i would do that.",
