            "displayName": "Angela Schreiber",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "extended patch that removes ValueConstraint in jcr2spi, fixes problems in\nthe spi-commons ValueConstraint and includes some trivial tests for the various types of value constraint.\n\nany objections for removing o.a.j.jcr2spi.nodetype.ValueConstraint?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=angela",
            "name": "angela",
            "key": "anchela",
            "avatarUrls": {
